hrough ForgeDock.\n\n### Steps\n1. Create the fixture with the exact required contents.\n2. Create the smoke test using `node:test` and `node:assert/strict`.\n3. Run the named `npm run check` verification.\n4. Inspect the diff and commit only the two allowed files.\n\n<!-- PLAN:COMPLETE -->"}}
